eas every time the countdown starts? Here are 25 fun, creative, and aesthetic photo booth poses.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/what-to-do-with-photo-strips\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"ideas\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/what-to-do-with-photo-strips-480.avif?v=878e4dd7 480w, /assets/blog/what-to-do-with-photo-strips-640.avif?v=f6e599f8 640w, /assets/blog/what-to-do-with-photo-strips-960.avif?v=a9c78540 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/what-to-do-with-photo-strips-480.webp?v=f9a611ac 480w, /assets/blog/what-to-do-with-photo-strips-640.webp?v=786d5bb1 640w, /assets/blog/what-to-do-with-photo-strips-960.webp?v=8357e866 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/what-to-do-with-photo-strips-960.webp?v=8357e866\" alt=\"Illustration of photo strips displayed on a wall and in an album\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>24 Things to Do With Your Photo Strips</h3><p>Displays, gifts, things to make and the storage habits that stop a collection quietly disappearing.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/aesthetic-photo-strip-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"ideas\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/aesthetic-photo-strip-ideas-480.avif?v=48ca2a7e 480w, /assets/blog/aesthetic-photo-strip-ideas-640.avif?v=e98707a1 640w, /assets/blog/aesthetic-photo-strip-ideas-960.avif?v=ccce71f2 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/aesthetic-photo-strip-ideas-480.webp?v=6ac3c46a 480w, /assets/blog/aesthetic-photo-strip-ideas-640.webp?v=98b3f73b 640w, /assets/blog/aesthetic-photo-strip-ideas-960.webp?v=0c748470 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/aesthetic-photo-strip-ideas-960.webp?v=0c748470\" alt=\"Illustration of photo strips in six different visual styles\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>Aesthetic Photo Strip Ideas: 6 Looks</h3><p>Six aesthetics with the exact lighting, palette and filter settings for each - plus which ones your webcam can actually handle.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/best-friend-photo-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"ideas\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/best-friend-photo-ideas-480.avif?v=91de9537 480w, /assets/blog/best-friend-photo-ideas-640.avif?v=5a5e0259 640w, /assets/blog/best-friend-photo-ideas-960.avif?v=a35712a6 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/best-friend-photo-ideas-480.webp?v=af4708c8 480w, /assets/blog/best-friend-photo-ideas-640.webp?v=a13bb93e 640w, /assets/blog/best-friend-photo-ideas-960.webp?v=027e1ffa 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/best-friend-photo-ideas-960.webp?v=027e1ffa\" alt=\"Illustration of a group of friends taking a photo strip together\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>20 Best Friend Photo Ideas Worth Keeping</h3><p>For when you are together, for friends in different cities, and for building a record that lasts a decade.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/solo-photo-booth-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"ideas\"><di