538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>22 Photo Booth Theme Ideas</h3><p>From decide-in-ten-seconds to a full costume evening - plus how to pick the right one for your group size.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/photo-strip-caption-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"ideas\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/photo-strip-caption-ideas-480.avif?v=b95ebe10 480w, /assets/blog/photo-strip-caption-ideas-640.avif?v=1cff1bf3 640w, /assets/blog/photo-strip-caption-ideas-960.avif?v=665c7deb 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/photo-strip-caption-ideas-480.webp?v=141f97e1 480w, /assets/blog/photo-strip-caption-ideas-640.webp?v=e2d69ea1 640w, /assets/blog/photo-strip-caption-ideas-960.webp?v=dc22b91a 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/photo-strip-caption-ideas-960.webp?v=dc22b91a\" alt=\"Illustration of a photo strip with caption text beneath it\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>120 Photo Strip Captions for Every Mood</h3><p>Short, funny, couples, friends, milestones and nostalgic - plus the four rules that separate a good caption from a bad one.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/photo-booth-prop-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"ideas\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/photo-booth-prop-ideas-480.avif?v=7e3338c9 480w, /assets/blog/photo-booth-prop-ideas-640.avif?v=6e1f8e38 640w, /assets/blog/photo-booth-prop-ideas-960.avif?v=88b19a2a 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/ass